# mod-custom-spells: the Rogue custom class spells (the /spells picker) on a
# bot. Every check states the CONCEPT's behaviour (share-public
# custom-spells/08-rework-20261008.md, concept source "Paragon Passive
# Spells"), so a FAIL marks a defect, not a typo.
# Test ground: map 13, the FL dummy arena - eight AoE Training Dummies
# (920018: take 0 damage, never die, the combat log still reads the full
# amount) on a 4-yd circle around (-270, 150). Melee chains only jump to units
# in front of the caster: chain checks stand west of the ring facing it.
# Gear: the rogue's starter Worn Dagger plus a Dirk (2139) for the off hand.
# Energy: base regeneration 10 per sec; a reset gives 100 and Distract (1725,
# cast at a point: it cannot miss, so it always costs its full 30 - a missed,
# dodged or parried strike costs only 0-11, Spell::TakePower) leaves 70, so
# 1.5 sec later a rogue has 85 (base) or 92.5 (+50 %).
# Poisons are weapon procs the core casts TRIGGERED (Player::CastItemCombatSpell);
# a bot cannot put a poison on a weapon (`use` sends no item target), so a
# triggered Instant Poison IX cast stands in for the proc.
# Spells: Distract 1725, Sinister Strike 48638, Hemorrhage 48660, Mutilate 48666 (its hits:
# main hand 48665, off hand 48664), Blade Flurry 13877 (extra hit 22482),
# Instant Poison IX 57965, Deadly Poison IX 57970 (DoT), Wound Poison VII
# 57975, Poison Nova 900604.
name    Custom spells - Rogue
timeout 300s

bot ro rogue slot=4

place 13 -279 150 -423.2 0
require ro alive
pick d1 creature:920018 near ro
require d1 exists
do gm target ro
as gm .unlearn 900600
as gm .unlearn 900601
as gm .unlearn 900602
as gm .unlearn 900603
as gm .unlearn 900633
as gm .unlearn 900634
as gm .unlearn 900635
as gm .unlearn 900636
as gm .unlearn 900637
as gm .unlearn 900666
as gm .unlearn 900667
as gm .unlearn 900668
as gm .unlearn 901101
as gm .unlearn 901102
as gm .unlearn 901103
as gm .unlearn 901104
as gm .unlearn 901111
as gm .unaura 13877
do ro learn 48638
do ro learn 48660
do ro learn 48666
do ro learn 13877
do ro learn 1725
do ro destroy 2139
as gm .additem 2139
do ro equip 2139
do ro approach d1
wait 1s

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- energy (all three specs)
log Energy - control: without a passive, 1.5 sec after Distract (100 -> 70) the rogue has 85
do ro reset
do ro cast 1725 at d1
wait 1500ms
expect ro power energy <= 88

log Assassination - 900600 Energy +50 %: 15 per sec, 92 1.5 sec after Distract
do ro learn 900600
do ro reset
do ro cast 1725 at d1
wait 1500ms
expect ro power energy >= 90
as gm .unlearn 900600

log Combat - 900637 Energy +50 %: 92 1.5 sec after Distract
do ro learn 900637
do ro reset
do ro cast 1725 at d1
wait 1500ms
expect ro power energy >= 90
as gm .unlearn 900637

log Subtlety - 900666 Energy +50 %: 92 1.5 sec after Distract
do ro learn 900666
do ro reset
do ro cast 1725 at d1
wait 1500ms
expect ro power energy >= 90
as gm .unlearn 900666

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Assassination
log Assassination - 900601 Mutilate +50 %: Mutilate and the two hits that deal its damage
do ro learn 900601
expect ro spellmod 48666 damage 100 == 150
expect ro spellmod 48665 damage 100 == 150
expect ro spellmod 48664 damage 100 == 150
as gm .unlearn 900601

log Assassination - 900602 Poison +50 %: Instant and Wound Poison hits, Deadly Poison ticks
do ro learn 900602
expect ro spellmod 57965 damage 100 == 150
expect ro spellmod 57975 damage 100 == 150
expect ro spellmod 57970 dot 100 == 150
as gm .unlearn 900602

log Assassination - 900603 Poison Nova (revision 2026-10-08): dealing damage with a poison has a 5 % chance, no cooldown, to set off Poison Nova 900604 - 666 + 5 x the Paragon level Nature on every other enemy within 10 yd of the target (the spelllog line's damage / hits). Weapon poisons are triggered casts: 150 triggered Instant Poison IX hits in one tick, about 7 novas - at least 2 shows there is no cooldown any more, at most 16 that the chance is no longer 15 % (statistical)
do ro learn 900603
spelllog start
do ro cast 57965 on d1 triggered
do ro cast 57965 on d1 triggered
do ro cast 57965 on d1 triggered
do ro cast 57965 on d1 triggered
do ro cast 57965 on d1 triggered
do ro cast 57965 on d1 triggered
do ro cast 57965 on d1 triggered
